&lt;li&gt;Establish and own best practices &amp;amp; training materials for data-savvy users within functional departments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a key leader in championing the impact of data, company-wide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to working with amazing colleagues who exemplify our ‘team over self’ core value, you will also have the opportunity to [EXAMPLE: sell an impactful and revolutionary software that is changing the way sellers sell.] You will have an opportunity to make a difference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
