&lt;p&gt;The Data &amp;amp; Analytics team consists of a group of curious, collaborative, and technically-driven individuals dedicated to empowering the business with data. The engineers and analysts on our team share a few common traits: they are passionate about turning data into actionable insights, thrive on solving complex problems, and are committed to leveraging cutting-edge technology to answer critical business questions.&lt;/p&gt;
