&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build scalable, tested transformation layers using DBT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing data pipelines with Airflow and ingestion tools such as Fivetran or Estuary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with AI-assisted development tools such as Snowflake Cortex, Gemini Enterprise, or GitHub Copilot.&lt;/li&gt;
