&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Business Case &amp;amp; Financial Modeling:&lt;/span&gt; Own the economic engine of the product org. Build rigorous financial models and business cases to justify new investments, market entries, and portfolio pivots.&lt;/p&gt;
