&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Orchestration:&lt;/span&gt; Serve as the primary connective tissue between Product, Sales, Marketing, and Finance. Align disparate departments to ensure product-led initiatives are supported company-wide.&lt;/p&gt;
