&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;New Product Introduction (NPI):&lt;/span&gt; Lead the cross-functional &quot;Go-to-Product&quot; engine. Own the operational readiness, field enablement, and launch synchronization for all major releases.&lt;/p&gt;
