&lt;p&gt;Join us to help transform how companies around the world run revenue — and build the platform that will guide leading revenue teams into the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE OPPORTUNITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Clari + Salesloft, our Senior Software Engineer will be pivotal to our company’s success. You will be a key member of our fast-growing and high-performing team in India. We are looking for experienced Senior Software Engineers who can help realize Clari + Salesloft vision with their passion and proven track record of excellence and innovation. We are looking for engineers who are passionate about their work and who thrive working on leading-edge cloud-based technologies to develop ground-breaking AI-driven enterprise-grade applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On a day-to-day basis, you will be responsible to -&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement solutions to improve availability and resiliency of Clari + Salesloft&#39;s services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve operational maturity by defining and implementing SLIs, SLOs, enable faster detection, and isolation of failures and proactively work to mitigate them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate on sustainable incident response, retrospectives, and identifying opportunities to improve user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for building and managing critical third-party services in our software stack, influencing system design, building fault tolerance and disaster recovery capabilities, optimizing systems to improve efficiency. You will participate in implementation of integrating these services to solve large-scale problems, and ensure problem-free, reliable and efficient functioning of these components.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams are empowered and expected to help realize Clari + Salesloft’&#39;s vision via active development and collaboration with our engineering partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to working with amazing colleagues who exemplify our ‘team over self’ core value, you will also have the opportunity to work on an impactful and revolutionary software that is changing the way sellers sell. You will have an opportunity to make a difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE’RE LOOKING FOR:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking Senior Software Engineer who would be Working on cutting-edge technologies alongside a highly motivated and skilled team eager to learn and grow together&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re looking for an opportunity to learn more, do more, and become more, then becoming a Senior Software Engineer is the career path for you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clari + Salesloft&#39;s Infrastructure organization builds systems and tools to enable engineering velocity in a reliable manner. We partner with engineering teams to establish standards, improve reliability, and increase cost-efficiency. This is a great opportunity to make a massive impact on scaling cloud infrastructure to meet the high demand and rapid growth of both users and workload per user.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clari + Salesloft&#39;s Infrastructure team builds systems and tools to enable engineering velocity in a reliable manner. We are looking for a Software Engineer to define and design solutions for us to meet our business needs for availability, performance, and reliability&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE SKILL SET:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant experience building distributed systems on a public cloud (AWS, GCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foundation in software application design and system internals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate effectively with other engineers to solve most complex technical problems.This involves mentoring, peer reviews, participating in technical design reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent troubleshooting and problem solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Clari + Salesloft, we are committed to creating an inclusive and supportive workplace where everyone belongs and can thrive. We focus on culture add, not culture fit, and believe our teams are made stronger by the unique perspectives, experiences, and identities each person brings.&lt;/p&gt;
